        <h2 class="js-split-text-gsap font-light text-center fp-headline-title">A New Standard in Wireless Charging</h2>
        <p class="js-split-text-gsap font-normal text-center fp-headline-description">FreePower Valet is a premium wireless charging surface that combines advanced multi-device technology with the refined beauty of Silestone® by Cosentino. Charge up to three devices at once, placing them freely anywhere on its surface, while a customizable halo light controlled via mobile app enhances the experience.</p>
