                    <div class="title-faqs">
                              <div class="header" id="faqs">

        <div class="d-flex">
          <p class="font-body-base text-uppercase font-normal"> FAQS </p>
            <svg width="25" height="24" viewBox="0 0 25 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M0 7.43897L20 7.43896L20 16.5613" stroke="currentColor" stroke-miterlimit="10" />
              <path d="M24 12.5613L20 16.5613L16 12.5613" stroke="currentColor" stroke-miterlimit="10" />
            </svg>
        </div>

        
      </div>                        <section class="bg-section section-faqs">
    
    <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
                    <div class="faq-item" 
                itemscope 
                itemprop="mainEntity" 
                itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" 
                gtm-label="faq_accordion_what-is-freepower"
            >
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="question">
                        <span class="font-body-base font-light number">01.</span>
                        <h3 itemprop="name" class="font-body-base font-normal">What is FreePower?</h3>
                    </div>
                    <span class="arrow">
                        <svg width="15" height="18" viewBox="0 0 15 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M14 9.5L7.5 16.5L1 9.5" stroke="#A4A4A4"/>
                            <line x1="7.5" y1="16.5" x2="7.5" y2="0.5" stroke="#A4A4A4"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                    <div class="answer">
                        <span class="font-body-base" itemprop="text">FreePower is a built-in wireless charging technology designed to be seamlessly integrated into surfaces like countertops and furniture, eliminating the need for visible charging pads or cables.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="faq-item" 
                itemscope 
                itemprop="mainEntity" 
                itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" 
                gtm-label="faq_accordion_how-does-freepower-wireless-charging-work"
            >
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="question">
                        <span class="font-body-base font-light number">02.</span>
                        <h3 itemprop="name" class="font-body-base font-normal">How does FreePower wireless charging work?</h3>
                    </div>
                    <span class="arrow">
                        <svg width="15" height="18" viewBox="0 0 15 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M14 9.5L7.5 16.5L1 9.5" stroke="#A4A4A4"/>
                            <line x1="7.5" y1="16.5" x2="7.5" y2="0.5" stroke="#A4A4A4"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                    <div class="answer">
                        <span class="font-body-base" itemprop="text">FreePower uses advanced multi-coil technology embedded beneath the surface to deliver power across the entire charging area. This allows you to place your device anywhere within the zone and charge it without precise alignment.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="faq-item" 
                itemscope 
                itemprop="mainEntity" 
                itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" 
                gtm-label="faq_accordion_what-materials-are-used-in-freepower-wireless-charging-countertops"
            >
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="question">
                        <span class="font-body-base font-light number">03.</span>
                        <h3 itemprop="name" class="font-body-base font-normal">What materials are used in FreePower wireless charging countertops?</h3>
                    </div>
                    <span class="arrow">
                        <svg width="15" height="18" viewBox="0 0 15 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M14 9.5L7.5 16.5L1 9.5" stroke="#A4A4A4"/>
                            <line x1="7.5" y1="16.5" x2="7.5" y2="0.5" stroke="#A4A4A4"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                    <div class="answer">
                        <span class="font-body-base" itemprop="text">FreePower wireless charging countertops are crafted using premium materials such as Silestone, combined with brushed copper finishes. This combination ensures durability and resistance while seamlessly integrating wireless charging technology into modern kitchen surfaces without compromising design.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="faq-item" 
                itemscope 
                itemprop="mainEntity" 
                itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" 
                gtm-label="faq_accordion_what-devices-are-compatible-with-freepower"
            >
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="question">
                        <span class="font-body-base font-light number">04.</span>
                        <h3 itemprop="name" class="font-body-base font-normal">What devices are compatible with FreePower?</h3>
                    </div>
                    <span class="arrow">
                        <svg width="15" height="18" viewBox="0 0 15 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M14 9.5L7.5 16.5L1 9.5" stroke="#A4A4A4"/>
                            <line x1="7.5" y1="16.5" x2="7.5" y2="0.5" stroke="#A4A4A4"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                    <div class="answer">
                        <span class="font-body-base" itemprop="text">FreePower works with most Qi-enabled smartphones and wireless charging devices. For optimal performance, avoid using thick cases or placing metal objects between your device and the charging surface.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="faq-item" 
                itemscope 
                itemprop="mainEntity" 
                itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" 
                gtm-label="faq_accordion_can-i-charge-multiple-devices-at-the-same-time-on-freepower"
            >
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="question">
                        <span class="font-body-base font-light number">05.</span>
                        <h3 itemprop="name" class="font-body-base font-normal">Can I charge multiple devices at the same time on FreePower?</h3>
                    </div>
                    <span class="arrow">
                        <svg width="15" height="18" viewBox="0 0 15 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M14 9.5L7.5 16.5L1 9.5" stroke="#A4A4A4"/>
                            <line x1="7.5" y1="16.5" x2="7.5" y2="0.5" stroke="#A4A4A4"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                    <div class="answer">
                        <span class="font-body-base" itemprop="text">Yes, FreePower allows you to charge multiple devices simultaneously across the same surface, thanks to its intelligent power distribution system.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="faq-item" 
                itemscope 
                itemprop="mainEntity" 
                itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" 
                gtm-label="faq_accordion_how-can-i-contact-freepower-support-for-help-with-my-order-shipping-or-installation-questions"
            >
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <div class="question">
                        <span class="font-body-base font-light number">06.</span>
                        <h3 itemprop="name" class="font-body-base font-normal">How can I contact FreePower support for help with my order, shipping, or installation questions?</h3>
                    </div>
                    <span class="arrow">
                        <svg width="15" height="18" viewBox="0 0 15 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M14 9.5L7.5 16.5L1 9.5" stroke="#A4A4A4"/>
                            <line x1="7.5" y1="16.5" x2="7.5" y2="0.5" stroke="#A4A4A4"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                    <div class="answer">
                        <span class="font-body-base" itemprop="text">If you need assistance with your order, shipping status or delivery issues, as well as product setup or installation questions, you can contact FreePower support at (833) 373-7697 or visit their help center for more information: https://www.freepower.io/help.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            </div>
</section>
                    </div>
                </article>
